sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler
    participant SS as SubscriptionService
    participant PPS as PaymentProcessingService
    participant CS as CurrencyService
    participant IS as InvoiceService
    participant ALS as AuditLogService
    participant EB as EventBus
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Scheduler: Daily cron job checks<br/>subscriptions due for renewal

    Scheduler->>SS: checkRenewalsNeeded()
    SS->>DB: Query subscriptions where<br/>nextBillingDate <= today
    DB-->>SS: List of subscriptions

    loop For each subscription
        SS->>SS: validateSubscriptionActive()

        alt Subscription is active
            SS->>CS: convertToUserCurrency(amount)
            CS-->>SS: Converted amount

            SS->>IS: createRenewalInvoice(subscription)
            IS-->>SS: Invoice created

            SS->>PPS: processPayment(invoice)

            alt Payment successful
                PPS-->>SS: PaymentResult (success)
                SS->>DB: Update subscription<br/>(nextBillingDate += period)
                SS->>ALS: Log renewal success
                SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.renewed'
                EB-->>SS: Event published

                SS->>IS: markInvoicePaid()
                SS->>SS: updateMetrics(MRR, ARR)

            else Payment failed
                PPS-->>SS: PaymentResult (failed)
                SS->>DB: Update subscription<br/>(status = past_due)
                SS->>ALS: Log renewal failure
                SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.payment_failed'

                SS->>SS: scheduleRetry(subscription)
                Note over SS: Retry schedule:<br/>Day 1, Day 3, Day 7

                alt Grace period active
                    SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.grace_period_started'
                else Max retries exceeded
                    SS->>SS: cancelSubscription(id)
                    SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.canceled'
                end
            end

        else Subscription paused
            SS->>SS: Skip renewal
            Note over SS: Billing suspended

        else Subscription canceled
            SS->>SS: checkIfExpired()
            alt Period ended
                SS->>SS: expireSubscription(id)
                SS->>EB: Emit 'subscription.expired'
            end
        end
    end

    SS-->>Scheduler: Renewal processing complete

    Note over SS,EB: All state changes are<br/>audited and event-driven
